    Test-only. NOT part of BoltSharp.slnx, following the repository convention for
    driver-dependent test projects (see B2-C-01, B0-B-DRV-INT-01, B5-B-Q1, B5-B-F01-R1-Q1).

    Written independently for the Q-B5B-05-PROBE-01 producer commission. Uses the accepted
